# Golden/eval fixtures are hashed (split_manifest.json sha256 freeze,
# .schema_version freshness markers, base-schema.md is the schema-version
# hash input) — keep their bytes byte-identical across platforms (no CRLF
# conversion, or the freshness/sha256 checks fail on Windows checkouts).
tests/eval/gold/*.json -text
tests/fixtures/gold/*.json -text
tests/fixtures/wikis/**/.schema_version -text
templates/_shared/base-schema.md -text
